'''Splitnir the Bleeding''' is the upgraded form of [[Splitnir]] using the [[Bloodstone]]. Like all upgraded-weapons that use Bloodstone, its damage is increased by 0.2% for every 1 point of [[health]] the player is missing ''(not to be confused with health percentage)''.

* Its primary attack is a thrust. 
* The secondary attack throws the spear for 1.5x damage.

An upgraded Splitnir will '''NOT''' keep its upgrade level when it is made into Splitnir the Bleeding.

